    "Build the string from left to right using backtracking.",
    "At index <code>i</code>, you can place <code>'1'</code> only if the previous character is not <code>'1'</code> and the new cost does not exceed <code>k</code>.",
    "Whenever the string reaches length <code>n</code>, add it to the answer."
